abstract: >-
  Source code, reproduction script, and selected result artefacts accompanying
  the paper "Reliability of Tabular ML Under Distribution Shift". The repository
  contains: implementations of split, weighted, and class-conditional Mondrian
  conformal prediction with the APS score; four post-hoc calibrators; the
  10-task main experimental grid runner; a budget-axis baseline (post-hoc CP
  vs retraining at varying target-label budgets); a deploy-time decision-tree
  analysis over density-ratio diagnostics; an effective-sample-size robustness
  appendix; and a one-command end-to-end reproduction script.
